Subject: CPMS I03E3 Proof Oracle and Review Protocol SJS Input Audit

@ [audit_uuid] c8d3242b-6cf7-4401-901f-609a873d62c8
@ [source_uuid] cac5fb29-0dc6-40ae-b17b-ce3cf91d600a
@ [source_sha256] 0A17B9C3A1B2C269AAD1A25F0B1F63FB18841D42C7372193F3EFC292E9CD6B5E

& [AuthorityInput] is sufficient for formation only and the exact source digest is bound

& [Correction1] replaces ambiguous mutual signing with two-phase cross acknowledgment
  + HonestyPrimary and SecurityPrimary contain independent conclusions and no peer digest
  + HonestyCrossAck and SecurityCrossAck each bind both primary digests
  + CrossConfirmationEnvelope binds both primaries both acknowledgments and dispositions
  + no record contains its own digest or requires a mutually recursive digest

& [Correction2] separates attestation integrity and cryptographic signature
  + receipt digest proves content identity only
  + attestation binds reviewer principal faculty profile and disposition under the project protocol
  + digital signature exists only with declared algorithm key id trusted key catalogue and verified signature bytes
  + CRC checksum and hash are never called signatures

& [Correction3] defines reviewer principals broadly but honestly
  + principal may be a person or separately authorized faculty process
  + a faculty process binds exact SOP profile model or engine job input output and execution identities
  + raw model prose without authorization and provenance cannot issue review authority

& [Correction4] records independence strength
  + procedural_only uses distinct faculty rules
  + separate_invocations uses distinct execution runs and immutable inputs
  + separate_principals uses independently authorized principals
  + later activation selects the minimum acceptable class rather than formation pretending one

& [Correction5] prevents oracle laundering
  + executing the implementation and copying its result is not an independent expectation source
  + semantic vectors require independent construction derivation or proof identity
  + source interpretation uncertainty becomes dissent or insufficient evidence

& [Correction6] keeps review complete rather than sampled
  + batch rationale may reduce duplication
  + every exact case claim and edge remains enumerated and dispositioned
  + sampling can audit reviewer quality but cannot admit omitted cases

& [Correction7] separates review candidate from execution authority
  + corpus_candidate_formed means review completeness only
  + a separate satisfaction signature and active phase lock are still required before any reader run

& [Correction8] removes hidden reasoning authority
  + normative receipts contain claims evidence references bounded rationale challenges and dispositions
  + private chain-of-thought is neither required nor accepted as proof

& [AuditDisposition] is source_valid_after_digest_binding_and_refinement_formation_allowed_receipt_issuance_forbidden
